            "clip": false,
            "text": "Freegma screens built from shared native components. Start in either theme folder.",
            "src": "",
            "icon": "sparkles",
            "id": "intro",
            "type": "text",
            "name": "intro",
            "parentId": "tour_guide",
            "colorBindings": [
              {
                "path": "color",
                "token": "muted",
                "source": "#afb4c5"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "x": 32,
            "y": 194,
            "width": 936,
            "height": 148,
            "rotation": 0,
            "fill": "transparent",
            "color": "#afb4c5",
            "stroke": "#dfe4ec",
            "strokeWidth": 0,
            "radius": 0,
            "opacity": 1,
            "fontSize": 18,
            "fontWeight": 400,
            "fontFamily": "Inter, system-ui, sans-serif",
            "lineHeight": 1.5,
            "textAlign": "left",
            "layout": "free",
            "gap": 16,
            "paddingTop": 0,
            "paddingRight": 0,
            "paddingBottom": 0,
            "paddingLeft": 0,
            "marginTop": 0,
            "marginRight": 0,
            "marginBottom": 0,
            "marginLeft": 0,
            "align": "start",
            "justify": "start",
            "sizing": "fixed",
            "visible": true,
            "locked": false,
            "clip": false,
            "text": "Feature tour\n  Shared studio components \u2014 edit these masters\n  Light Mode / Layer inspector & spacing \u2014 linked uses\n  Dark Mode / Layer inspector & spacing \u2014 the same shared masters",
            "src": "",
            "icon": "sparkles",
            "id": "structure",
            "type": "text",
            "name": "structure",
            "parentId": "tour_guide",
            "colorBindings": [
              {
                "path": "color",
                "token": "muted",
                "source": "#afb4c5"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "x": 32,
            "y": 370,
            "width": 936,
            "height": 280,
            "rotation": 0,
            "fill": "transparent",
            "color": "#afb4c5",
            "stroke": "#dfe4ec",
            "strokeWidth": 0,
            "radius": 0,
            "opacity": 1,
            "fontSize": 17,
            "fontWeight": 400,
            "fontFamily": "Inter, system-ui, sans-serif",
            "lineHeight": 1.5,
            "textAlign": "left",
            "layout": "free",
            "gap": 16,
            "paddingTop": 0,
            "paddingRight": 0,
            "paddingBottom": 0,
            "paddingLeft": 0,
            "marginTop": 0,
            "marginRight": 0,
            "marginBottom": 0,
            "marginLeft": 0,
            "align": "start",
            "justify": "start",
            "sizing": "fixed",
            "visible": true,
            "locked": false,
            "clip": false,
            "text": "1. Select Task card. Its inherited properties are locked but browsable.\n2. Go to main component. Edit its Corner; both Light and Dark uses follow.\n3. Enable one local override, edit it, then Reset to the current master.\n4. Open Colors \u2192 Text. Change it to #8FE1C7: primary text AND the card outline change.\n   Background and Muted stay unchanged. Save once; Ctrl+Z restores the color.\n5. Switch Design theme to recolor these same components.\n6. Generate React from the master; edit CSS and Apply CSS to design.",
            "src": "",
            "icon": "sparkles",
            "id": "steps",
            "type": "text",
            "name": "steps",
            "parentId": "tour_guide",
            "colorBindings": [
              {
                "path": "color",
                "token": "muted",
                "source": "#afb4c5"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
